命令：CodeGen.exe Tools/CodeGen/BindableShapes.RenderResource.h --list-bind-interfaces ... -xc++
退出码：0
  IBindRenderResource=ca_bind_fixture::IBindRenderResource
  IBindRenderResourceAlt=ca_bind_fixture::IBindRenderResourceAlt

命令：CodeGen.exe Tools/CodeGen/BindableShapes.RenderOwner.h --list-bind-interfaces ... -xc++
退出码：0
